Package: txt-editor
Version: 0.1.0
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: kemenion <dev@kemenion.local>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libatk1.0-0t64 | libatk1.0-0, libepoxy0, libfontconfig1, zlib1g, libexpat1, libpng16-16t64 | libpng16-16
Description: minimal, fast Linux text editor
 txt-editor is a small GUI text/code editor built with C++20, wxWidgets
 and Scintilla/Lexilla. It supports UTF-8/UTF-16/ISO-8859-1, LF/CRLF/CR,
 syntax highlighting, tabs, find/replace and atomic saves.
